{
  "id": "draft.dialogue.mikoto.first",
  "kind": "dialogue",
  "title": "事务所里有个没见过的女人",
  "status": "approved",
  "version": 1,
  "rootId": "draft.dialogue.mikoto.first",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.mikoto.first",
    "idolId": "mikoto",
    "startNodeId": "1",
    "nodes": {
      "1": {
        "id": "1",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "──打扰了。社长，说要让我见的人是──……",
        "nextNodeId": "2"
      },
      "2": {
        "id": "2",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "社长的话出去了哦。说有别的事必须处理。",
        "nextNodeId": "3"
      },
      "3": {
        "id": "3",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "诶…………你是……！",
        "nextNodeId": "4"
      },
      "4": {
        "id": "4",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "──緋田美琴。请多指教。",
        "nextNodeId": "5"
      },
      "5": {
        "id": "5",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "请、请多指教……话说回来你……！",
        "nextNodeId": "6"
      },
      "6": {
        "id": "6",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "你怎么会在这里……？",
        "nextNodeId": "7"
      },
      "7": {
        "id": "7",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "…………我之前组的组合，活动结束了。",
        "nextNodeId": "8"
      },
      "8": {
        "id": "8",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "之后也退出了原来的事务所，正在找新的地方。",
        "nextNodeId": "9"
      },
      "9": {
        "id": "9",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "所以，我想参加 283 制作的甄选。",
        "nextNodeId": "10"
      },
      "10": {
        "id": "10",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "诶…………！",
        "nextNodeId": "11"
      },
      "11": {
        "id": "11",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "我去问了，事务所就让我过来了。",
        "nextNodeId": "12"
      },
      "12": {
        "id": "12",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "天井社长让我在这里等制作人……",
        "nextNodeId": "13"
      },
      "13": {
        "id": "13",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "你就是那位制作人？",
        "nextNodeId": "14"
      },
      "14": {
        "id": "14",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "是、是的。我是做制作人的……",
        "nextNodeId": "15"
      },
      "15": {
        "id": "15",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "这样。太好了。那么──",
        "nextNodeId": "16"
      },
      "16": {
        "id": "16",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "283 制作在签偶像的时候，要做怎样的测试？",
        "nextNodeId": "17"
      },
      "17": {
        "id": "17",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "舞蹈？唱歌？还是别的什么？",
        "nextNodeId": "18"
      },
      "18": {
        "id": "18",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "反正，我什么都准备好再来的。",
        "nextNodeId": "19"
      },
      "19": {
        "id": "19",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……………………我明白了。",
        "nextNodeId": "20"
      },
      "20": {
        "id": "20",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "那样的话，现在就到练习室，让我看看你的歌和舞，可以吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "21"
      },
      "21": {
        "id": "21",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "当然。今天就是为了这个来的。",
        "nextNodeId": "22"
      },
      "22": {
        "id": "22",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "好。那么请往这边──",
        "nextNodeId": "23"
      },
      "23": {
        "id": "23",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "──呐，制作人。",
        "nextNodeId": "24"
      },
      "24": {
        "id": "24",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯？",
        "nextNodeId": "25"
      },
      "25": {
        "id": "25",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "我想当偶像。",
        "nextNodeId": "26"
      },
      "26": {
        "id": "26",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "……想到要死。",
        "nextNodeId": "27"
      },
      "27": {
        "id": "27",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "────……",
        "nextNodeId": "28"
      },
      "28": {
        "id": "28",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……测试，我会认真看的。",
        "nextNodeId": "29"
      },
      "29": {
        "id": "29",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "うん……ありがとう。"
      }
    }
  },
